Creating a Forensic Image using FTK Imager/Encase Imager : - open the ftk imager 

- Creating Forensic Image - File > Create Disk Image > select physical drive > create raw > crated.

 - Check Integrity of Data > when the process is done the the hashesh will be shown write it to check the integrity of data 

 - Analyze Forensic Image - after creating the ftk image open the file > add evidence item > select the image created > analyze